title: Titanspan

type: software

authors:
  - given-names: Jerome
    family-names: Thayananthajothy
    website: 'https://thavarshan.com'

abstract: >-
  Titanspan is an independent, open-source, async-first
  Python application framework for building intelligent
  systems at scale. It provides expressive APIs, application
  lifecycle management, dependency integration, stateful
  workflow orchestration, and scalable application
  infrastructure.

repository-code: 'https://github.com/titanspan/titanspan'

license: MIT

keywords:
  - Python
  - Application framework
  - Artificial intelligence
  - Agentic AI
  - Workflow orchestration
  - Dependency injection
  - Asynchronous programming
  - Distributed systems
  - Data processing
  - Open source
